OL,3,APolice investigate unknown substance
OL,4,Athat caused Manchester's Co-op Live
OL,5,Aevacuation
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are investigating after
OL,8,Fthousands of people were evacuated from
OL,9,Fa concert in Manchester following an
OL,10,F"unknown substance" being released into
OL,11,Fthe crowd.
OL,13,FIt happened towards the end of US
OL,14,Frapper Don Toliver's show at the Co-op
OL,15,FLive arena at about 22:00 GMT on
OL,16,FSunday, with fans describing a
OL,17,F"horrible smell" and people "screaming"
OL,18,Fand "coughing up blood".
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
