OL,3,ARussell Brand's wife says she'll honour
OL,4,Aprison rules after message row
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said on Sunday that she would
OL,7,Fcontinue to defend her family and
OL,8,Fherself over her portrayal in the media
OL,9,Fduring the couple's weekly podcast,
OL,10,Fwhich she now presents alone.
OL,12,FRussell Brand, 51, is currently serving
OL,13,Fa 10-and-half-year prison sentence
OL,14,Fafter being convicted of rape and three
OL,15,Fcounts of sexual assault.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
